silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_05_value_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'ValueLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Value Leg', the value_attribution_arrow Value_3450 -> WeightMeas_3450g: this specific quantity 3450 is attributed to this specific measurement event; monic because Value_3450 is attributed to exactly one measurement event in this diagram.; also, In 'Value Leg', the real_number_typing_arrow records that Value_3450 is a real number; RealNumberType is shared by all numeric values, so this arrow is not monic." .
